  "question": {
    "text": "A flask is filled with equal moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>. The half lives of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> respectively and are independent of the initial concentration. The time required for the concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> to be four times that of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;is____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>.<br />(Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "200",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For first order reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mi>sec</mi></math></p>",
